# 换行统一成 LF（仓库里和检出后都是 LF）。
# Node / JS / CSS / HTML / Markdown 在 Windows 上也都吃 LF，不需要 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则部分 cmd.exe 会解析错行。
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何换行或编码转换。
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.otf  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.tgz  binary

# 让 GitHub 的语言统计不把第三方库算成我们的代码。
note-studio/public/vendor/**     linguist-vendored
note-studio/acceptance/output/** linguist-generated
forum-ai/examples/demo-output.json linguist-generated
note-studio/examples/output/**   linguist-generated
